# COMPONENT

## CbdSupport

### PACKAGE

org.simplemodeling.textus.cbdsupport

### DESCRIPTION

Textus CBD Support aggregates authoritative CAR and SAR catalogs and exposes component discovery, exact component detail, dependency, operation, and usage guidance for Component-Based Development.

# SERVICE

## CbdRetrieval

### DESCRIPTION

Read-only CBD operations intended for publication through MCP.

### OPERATION

#### searchComponents

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ComponentSearchRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ComponentSearchResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Search catalog component profiles and local development/CAR observations by requirement, identity, version, source, freshness, availability state, conflict, and reconciliation-purpose filters, citing BoK semantic evidence separately without selecting a hidden winner.

#### getComponent

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ComponentLookupRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ComponentLookupResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Resolve one exact catalog component identity without inventing unavailable versions or metadata.

#### getUsage

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ComponentUsageRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ComponentUsageResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return generated contract references, operation summaries, documentation, and artifact evidence for one catalog component.

#### resolveDependencies

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

DependencyResolutionRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

DependencyResolutionResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return direct and bounded transitive dependency evidence for one catalog component, including unresolved paths and explicit version conflicts without choosing a winner.

#### listCatalogs

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

CatalogListRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

CatalogListResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

List authorized information sources, including component catalogs, BoK sites, public SIE BoK routes, development directories, and local/cache CAR storage, with current readiness, freshness, refresh-attempt state, and sanitized configuration diagnostics.

#### status

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

CbdStatusRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

CbdStatusResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Report federated information-source readiness, selected component counts, and degraded source state.

#### getReviewRun

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewRunRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewRunResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return authorized, bounded, redacted progress for one CBD-owned Review Run and its bound CNCF Job.

### OPERATION

#### getReviewSummary

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

GetReviewSummaryRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewSummaryResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return one authorized, bounded, redacted canonical Review Report summary by exact Report ID. This operation never enumerates Review history.

### OPERATION

#### getReviewReport

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

GetReviewReportRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewReportResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return one authorized, bounded, redacted canonical Review Report by exact Report ID without Evidence facts or rationale.

### OPERATION

#### listReviewFindings

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ListReviewFindingsRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewObservationResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return a bounded, redacted Finding projection for one exact Report ID. This operation never enumerates Review history.

### OPERATION

#### listReviewAssurances

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ListReviewAssurancesRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewObservationResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return a bounded, redacted Assurance projection for one exact Report ID. This operation never enumerates Review history.

### OPERATION

#### getReviewViews

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

GetReviewViewsRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewViewsResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return canonical CNCF, implementation, and quality views plus catalog-driven named quality views for one exact Report ID. Named views are discovered from capability definitions rather than fixed response fields. Each item keeps canonical Evidence/Observation IDs and provider/location navigation links.

## CbdCatalogAdmin

### DESCRIPTION

Administrative catalog refresh operations. This service is never MCP ready.

### OPERATION

#### refreshCatalog

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

CatalogRefreshRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

CatalogRefreshResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Refresh one configured catalog or all enabled catalogs while preserving the last known good snapshot on source failure.

## CbdReviewAdmin

### DESCRIPTION

Private Review execution and cancellation operations for Web, CLI, sbt-cozy, and internal callers. This service is never MCP ready.

### OPERATION

#### startReview

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewStartRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewRunResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Authorize and admit one digest-bound Review target, create one Review ID, submit one CNCF Job, and return their stable binding.

#### cancelReview

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewCancelRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewRunResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Authorize cancellation and propagate it to the CNCF Job bound to one non-terminal Review Run.

### OPERATION

#### submitReviewDocuments

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewSubmissionRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewSubmissionResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Accept one bounded provider-document submission through the private HTTP or local CLI boundary and return only the CBD-owned canonical response.

### OPERATION

#### post

##### TYPE

COMMAND

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewHttpSubmissionRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewSubmissionResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Private HTTP POST gateway operation. It accepts the Review submission document in the generated request envelope and returns the CBD-owned canonical response envelope.

### OPERATION

#### getReviewDashboard

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewDashboardRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewDashboardResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return one authorized, redacted dashboard for one exact canonical Review Report. This private Web query never enumerates history, invokes a provider, or changes a Review conclusion.

### OPERATION

#### getReviewDiagnosis

##### TYPE

QUERY

##### INPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewDiagnosisRequest

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE

ReviewDiagnosisResponse

##### DESCRIPTION

Return one authorized, redacted Observation or capability diagnosis for one exact canonical Review Report. Missing or unsupported items remain explicit and no fallback Report is selected.

# COMMAND

## CatalogRefreshRequest

### DESCRIPTION

Administrative request to refresh configured catalogs.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| sourceId | CatalogSourceId | ? |

## ReviewStartRequest

### DESCRIPTION

Private request to start one digest-bound Review Run. Server-side target admission never accepts a caller host path through this contract.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| targetKind | ReviewTargetKind | 1 |
| organization | ComponentOrganization | ? |
| name | ComponentName | 1 |
| version | ComponentVersion | ? |
| targetDigest | ReviewDigest | 1 |
| profile | ReviewProfile | 1 |

## ReviewCancelRequest

### DESCRIPTION

Private request to cancel one Review Run by its CBD-owned identity.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| reviewId | ReviewId | 1 |

## ReviewSubmissionRequest

### DESCRIPTION

Private transport request containing the exact `textus.cbd.review-submission.v1` document. It never contains caller roles, a workspace path, process command, credentials, a Report template, or a Gate.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| submissionDocument | ReviewSubmissionDocument | 1 |

## ReviewHttpSubmissionRequest

### DESCRIPTION

Private HTTP gateway envelope for one exact Review submission document.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| submissionDocument | ReviewSubmissionDocument | 1 |

