| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| sourceId | ComponentSourceId | ? |
| catalogId | CatalogSourceId | ? |
| organization | ComponentOrganization | ? |
| name | ComponentName | 1 |
| title | ComponentTitle | 1 |
| kind | ComponentKind | 1 |
| version | ComponentVersion | ? |
| evidenceUri | ComponentReferenceUri | 1 |

