## ReviewDiagnosis

### FEATURES

extends = ["SimpleEntity"]
usageKind = "task"
operationKind = "task"
applicationDomain = "system"

### Attribute

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| id | entityid | 1 |
| key_definition_id | ReviewReuseKeyDefinition | 1 |
| reuse_key_digest | ReviewDigest | 1 |
| state | ReviewRunState | 1 |
| active_review_id | ReviewId | ? |
| target_digest | ReviewDigest | 1 |
| profile | ReviewProfile | 1 |
| created_at | ReviewInstant | 1 |
| completed_at | ReviewInstant | ? |
| report_id | ReviewReportId | ? |
| report_digest | ReviewDigest | ? |

