| targets | ReviewTargetSnapshot | composition | * | diagnosis_id |
| runs | ReviewRunSnapshot | composition | * | diagnosis_id |
| reports | ReviewReportSnapshot | composition | * | diagnosis_id |
| attestations | ReviewAttestationSnapshot | composition | * | diagnosis_id |
| retention_events | ReviewRetentionEvent | composition | * | diagnosis_id |

