| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| id | entityid | 1 |
| key_definition_id | ReviewReuseKeyDefinition | 1 |
| reuse_key_digest | ReviewDigest | 1 |
| state | ReviewRunState | 1 |
| active_review_id | ReviewId | ? |
| report_id | ReviewReportId | ? |
| report_digest | ReviewDigest | ? |

### VIEW

- REBUILDABLE :: true

